OL,3,GNEWSAWhy key parts of Coventry could be
OL,4,Arenamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to rename two council wards in
OL,7,FCoventry has sparked debate over
OL,8,Fwhether the changes are needed at all.
OL,10,FLeaflets have been delivered to
OL,11,Fhouseholds in the Tile Hill and Canley
OL,12,Fward and the Woodlands ward asking
OL,13,Fresidents whether the areas should be
OL,14,Frenamed following a petition signed by
OL,15,F241 people.
OL,17,FResidents are being asked to give their
OL,18,Fopinion via a QR code consultation that
OL,19,Fopened on 9 September and runs until 21
OL,20,FOctober. Some have told the BBC they
OL,21,Foppose the proposed changes.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
