OL,3,GNEWSAWhy key parts of Coventry could be
OL,4,Arenamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet Member for Community Safety and
OL,7,FCohesion, John McNicholas, said the
OL,8,Fcouncil is "obliged to consider
OL,9,Fpetitions" and it is "following a
OL,10,Fprocess of democracy to ensure people's
OL,11,Fvoices are heard".
